InfoNES Rockbox plugin
======================

This directory contains a Rockbox port of InfoNES, imported from:

    https://github.com/jay-kumogata/InfoNES

The upstream repository contains an Apache-2.0 license file, copied here as
LICENSE.Apache-2.0. The historical InfoNES development notes also describe the
original open source release as GPL. Keep this plugin isolated when changing
licensing or redistribution packaging.

Initial Rockbox limitations:

- Raw .nes files only; zipped ROMs must be extracted first.
- Audio is intentionally muted until the PCM path is wired and profiled.
- Controls are tuned for iPod clickwheel targets first.
